    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Fine-Tuning Robot Policies While Maintaining User Privacy
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Christie%2C+B+A">Benjamin A. Christie</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Parekh%2C+S">Sagar Parekh</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Losey%2C+D+P">Dylan P. Losey</a>
      
